<p class="note models-line">Jev and Laya are fast decision models: each reads a text and answers a yes-or-no question about it instantly, with no reasons. We ran Laya two ways, an Apple MLX build and the original PyTorch build. Their headline results matched, and each result says which build gave it.</p>
